            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "In the SWMM component, rainfall is transformed into runoff using the Green-Ampt infiltration method (Chow et al., 1988), with depression storage incorporated to estimate effective rainfall. Runoff from each sub-catchment bounded by delineated drainage networks is routed using the kinematic wave approximation of the Saint-Venant equations.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
