            "relation": "HAS_SOURCE_COMPONENT",
            "target_entity_instance": "HEC-RAS 2D",
            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "The hydrologic outputs from SWMM were dynamically ingested into the HEC-RAS 2D hydraulic module, where exfiltrated or ponded discharges from SWMM junctions served as lateral inflow boundary conditions. HEC-RAS then governed surface flow propagation via the 2D shallow water equations, resolving flood extent, depth, and velocity across the hydraulic grid.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
